  "the_tail": "what the banks give out after the last frame came without the gain; a unit test holds it to twice the tail of the same stream without a gain, for a gain of two",
  "mutations": {
   "run": 26,
   "caught": 26,
   "of_the_clip_gain": 9
  }
 },
 "reading": "On 65 changes of one stream Dolby's decoder takes the clip gain from the value of the frame before to the value of the frame in a straight line over the first 256 samples the frame decodes to: 0.029, 0.092 and 0.154 of the way in the first three steps of 16 samples on the LFE, 0.967 in the sixteenth and all of it from sample 256, the objects the same; where it holds it is the value of the payload to 3.5e-06 in 1255 frames. That line applied to what leaves the decoder brings the LFE to Dolby's and the lowest band of the objects only to 57.1 dB; applied to the downmix before the objects are made of it, it brings that band to 125.94 dB, where the step at the output left 31.04. Over the library the fourteen tracks whose gain changes stand at 126.4 dB in the lowest band at the median where they stood at 49.0, and at 58.5 over the whole band where they stood at 45.0; the lowest band is under 90 dB on 0 tracks where it was on 14; every figure of the other 113 tracks is what it was. Of the corpus of 132 streams 3 changed, the 3 that carry JOC with a gain that is not 1 throughout."
}
